@startuml
[*] --> StartIconCreation
StartIconCreation --> SelectDesignOptions : User selects design options
SelectDesignOptions --> CustomizeIcon : User customizes icon
CustomizeIcon --> SaveIcon : User saves the custom icon
SaveIcon --> ShareIcon : User shares the custom icon
ShareIcon --> [*] : Process completes
ShareIcon --> StartIconCreation : User creates another custom icon
SaveIcon --> [*] : User exits without sharing
@enduml
